Changes in this adaptation:
- Extracted the existing-HTML-plus-requested-change refinement mechanism into
  buildOpenUILocalPrompt, a pure TypeScript function.
- Added CSS, factual context and a strict HTML/CSS JSON response contract.
- Replaced the original Tailwind/placeholder-image/JavaScript guidance with
  Bulgarian static-site, no-external-dependency and factual-content rules.
- Removed the browser OpenAI client, all paid-provider selection, credentials,
  vision model switching, model calls, streaming transport, telemetry and logs.
- The Academy caller supplies an explicitly local transport and server-side
  validation. The complete OpenUI application or agent runtime is not embedded.

